# Run the route a roqsim navigator was configured with (its `goals:`), and finish when it does.
#
# The goal carries nothing: the route belongs to the world, and only the moment it starts belongs to
# the caller. A mover with no configured route serves no such action. Cancelling stops the mover
# where it stands, and a newer goal on the same mover aborts this one.
---
---
# The same progress fields nav2's NavigateThroughPoses reports, so a client reads both alike.
int16 number_of_poses_remaining
float32 distance_remaining
builtin_interfaces/Duration navigation_time
